==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Shachiko]] spawns.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The strategy for this stage should seem decently apparent considering you've made it this far into Zero Legends: Lure and eviscerate Shachiko with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]], then chip down the Relic and Aku threats with [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]. The Metals seem intimidating at first, but Metal One Horn's health is low enough to be defeated in a hit or two by a reasonably-leveled [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], who will also deal with Metal Doge and slip into Ackey's blind spot to avoid damage.  Plus, they provide as stepping stones for Uril.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]]: Doubles up as a critter for Metal Doge and a shield piercer for Miz Devil (and Ackey if you're lucky!) with good range and fast attacks.
*[[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Brass Cat]]: Your main Shield Piercer for this stage. Brass can snipe Ackey's Shield with a Mini-Wave using the Metals, and is preferable to Supercar in this stage because of the peons and Lowkey blocking and killing Supercar before it can connect.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: Uses the Metals to generate powerful Wave Attacks that chip Lowkey and chunk the other non-metals. Cheap, disposable and fast too.

